  "summary": "天同巳亥与天梁对宫，夫妻卯酉为空须借对宫作用且减力。亥命例夫妻酉为空、巨机对照；弱命弱夫妻须多吉少煞才缓婚姻不利。四马之地使星曜动性增强，天同水性亦动。仅原文水性，不补阴阳；图盘不复原。",
  "summary_en": "Tian Tong at Si or Hai faces Tian Liang, with an empty Spouse Palace at Mao or You requiring a discounted opposite-palace influence. The Hai Life example has empty You Spouse borrowing Ju Men–Tian Ji. Weak Life and Spouse placements require many benefics and few malefics to mitigate relationship difficulties. The Four Horse locations amplify movement, including Tian Tong’s water quality. No yin–yang property or chart reconstruction is supplied beyond the readable text.",
